98|file in `scripts/run-tests.mjs` `buildBranches` — required by the gate).
99|
100|Expected: both tests pass against current code, which *pins* the behaviour.
101|The loop itself is the composition: refusal -> `client.interrupt` with reason
102|-> Rule-0 re-queue -> same runner re-claims -> refusal again.
103|
104|## 3. Safe local replication (backend side, vitest)
105|
106|Pin the counter/park behaviour with mocks, following
107|`api/flow/executionLedger.test.js` (`claimed(ctx)` helper). Proposed file
108|(code stage): `api/flow/executionLedger.capInterruptLoop.test.js`
109|
110|```js
